{
  "_about": "The Haluna smith at the forge (haluna.tscn NPCs/Town/Smith, the haluna_forge shop), about 42 (M3-CHR-516). Big, heavy-shouldered and forge-dark: short black hair, a black stubble, soot in the fingertips; an undyed work shirt with the sleeves pushed up and rolled above the elbow, indigo knee trousers, a wide hide apron to the knee straight over them (the fifth cloth slot, cloth_d, tuned less sheeny), a narrow brown tie at the waist, sandals. Reach-bands left 1, right 1: a smith, not a sailor. Face sliders relative to the MakeHuman donor (ADR 0021: 1.0 / 0.0 = unchanged). Keys starting with '_' are read by the villager_* modules (villager_hair, villager_costume, villager_textures, write_materials, villager_clips), not by bb_params.",
